<!doctype html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: justify; color: #111; }
      h1 { font-size: 16pt; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 12pt; }
      .watermark {
        position: fixed;
        top: 45%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-30deg);
        font-size: 64pt;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: -1;
      }
      .footer {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 1cm;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 10pt;
        color: #333;
      }
      .meta { margin-bottom: 12pt; }
      ol { padding-left: 1.3cm; }
      li { margin-bottom: 8pt; }
      .section { margin-bottom: 10pt; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="watermark">CONFIDENTIAL</div>
    <h1>NON-DISCLOSURE AGREEMENT (NDA)</h1>

    <div class="meta">
      <div><b>Date:</b> {{date}}</div>
      <div><b>Jurisdiction:</b> {{#if jurisdiction}}{{jurisdiction}}{{else}}Mumbai, Maharashtra{{/if}}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      This Non-Disclosure Agreement ("Agreement") is entered into on {{date}} between:
      <br/>
      <br/>
      <b>Party A:</b> {{party_a_name}}, {{party_a_address}}
      <br/>
      <b>Party B:</b> {{party_b_name}}, {{party_b_address}}
      <br/>
      <br/>
      Purpose: {{purpose}} for duration of {{duration_months}} months.
    </div>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <b>Definition of Confidential Information.</b> "Confidential Information" means any non-public information disclosed by Party A or Party B, whether in written, oral, electronic, or any other form, including but not limited to documents, data, business plans, pricing, and know-how.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Obligations of Receiving Party.</b> The receiving party shall protect the Confidential Information using at least the same degree of care it uses to protect its own confidential information, but not less than reasonable care, and shall not disclose it to any third party.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Permitted Use.</b> The Confidential Information shall be used solely for the Purpose stated in this Agreement and for no other purpose.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Exclusions.</b> Confidential Information shall not include information that: (a) becomes publicly available through no fault of the receiving party; (b) was lawfully known to the receiving party prior to disclosure; or (c) is received from a third party without breach of any obligation.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Duration.</b> This Agreement shall remain effective for {{duration_months}} months from the date of execution, and the confidentiality obligations shall survive for such period.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Return or Destruction.</b> Upon written request of the disclosing party, the receiving party shall promptly return or destroy all copies of Confidential Information.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>No License.</b> Nothing in this Agreement grants any license or other rights to the receiving party with respect to the disclosing party's Confidential Information except as expressly set out for the Purpose.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Governing Law and Jurisdiction.</b> This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of {{#if jurisdiction}}{{jurisdiction}}{{else}}Mumbai, Maharashtra{{/if}}, and disputes shall be subject to competent courts in the said jurisdiction.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Entire Agreement.</b> This Agreement constitutes the entire agreement between the parties regarding the subject matter and supersedes prior understandings.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Signatures.</b> The parties agree to be bound by this Agreement as of the date first written above.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div style="margin-top: 18pt;">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          <div><b>Party A</b></div>
          <div style="margin-top: 36pt;">Name: {{party_a_name}}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          <div><b>Party B</b></div>
          <div style="margin-top: 36pt;">Name: {{party_b_name}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">This document is generated by NextGenLegal and is legally valid under Indian law</div>
  </body>
</html>

